<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY TWO.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY TWO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round women's singles</p>
<p>results at the Wimbledon tennis championships on Tuesday (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>* denotes new result</p>
<p>* Yuka Yoshida (Japan) beat Rika Hiraki (Japan) 6-2 6-3</p>
